By using GWAY you accept these terms.

1. Your account belongs to you; you are responsible for your information being accurate and for keeping your account secure.
2. You may not share content that violates the rights of others or that is illegal, harassing or misleading.
3. Groups have their own rules; group admins and disciplinary boards enforce them.
4. GWAY may remove content that breaks the rules and suspend accounts.
5. You can delete your account at any time; your data is permanently deleted 30 days after the deletion request.$legal$),
